  "task_id": 9241,
  "title": "The future of good food in China",
  "author": "Matilda Ho",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/matilda_ho_the_future_of_good_food_in_china",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T08:59:11.086960Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T08:59:11.086960Z",
  "lead_time": 27.617,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "I was six when I had the first chance to learn what patience means.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A84023943F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 25,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "magic box",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5C6C96434",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 98,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "gift for life",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABC4C3A231",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "My grandmother gave me a magic box as a birthday present, which neither of us knew would become a gift for life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4BA4AE5FA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "I became obsessed with magic, and at 20, I became an amateur dove magician.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4D8A553530",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "This act of magic requires that I train my doves to sit and wait inside my clothing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B562059FB3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 44,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "to make them appear",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6B0BE35FF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 122,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "magical act",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "180F4097F3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 210,
        "text": "As a young magician, I was always in a rush to make them appear, but my teacher told me the secret to the success of this magical act is to make my doves appear only after they've waited patiently in my tuxedo.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3EF9C12CC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "It has to be a mindful kind of patience, the kind that took me some years to master.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62DC908A15",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "When life took me to Shanghai seven years ago, the mindful patience I learned became almost impossible to practice.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B70F8D36FC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 48,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "hurry",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9752D5E92",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 55,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "you need",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3445B9F64E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "In China, where everyone and everything is in a hurry, you need to outperform over 1.3 billion other people to build a better life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D92C953E61",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "You hack the system, bend the rules, circumvent the boundaries.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C57CC4173",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "It is the same when it comes to food ... except that when it comes to food, impatience can have dire consequences.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3A78100758",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 158,
        "text": "In the haste to grow more, sell more, 4,000 years of agriculture in a country of rich natural resources is spoiled by the overuse of chemicals and pesticides.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "02CDD23E82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "In 2016, the Chinese government revealed half a million food safety violations in just nine months.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1C5C5025A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Alarmingly, one in every four diabetics in the world now comes from China.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43C17F75A0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "The stories around food are scary and somewhat overwhelming, and I told myself it's time to bring a mindful patience into the impatience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C5C3CBFF6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "When I say mindful patience, I don't mean the ability to wait.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DA8911EF7A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "I mean knowing how to act while waiting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E5E8D21055",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "And so, while I wait for the day when a sustainable food system becomes a reality in China, I launched one of China's first online farmers market to bring local, organically grown produce to families.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0DED4006C6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "When we went live, 18 months ago, the food we could sell then was somewhat dismal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F39CFD3A5C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 165,
        "text": "We had no fruit and hardly any meat to sell, as none that was sent to the lab passed our zero tolerance test towards pesticides, chemicals, antibiotics and hormones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "268FF9419A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "I told our very anxious employees that we would not give up until we've met every local farmer in China.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CB622D387",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "Today, we supply 240 types of produce from 57 local farmers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A72F4AFEF9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "After almost one year of searching, we finally found chemical-free bananas grown in the backyards of villagers on Hainan Island.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9A89FA5F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 39,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "on an island that even Google Maps does not have coordinates for",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A09100D71F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 128,
        "endOffset": 175,
        "text": "cows eat grass and roam free under the blue sky",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ACDB327E43",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "We also work hard on logistics.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E658C135B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "We deliver our customers' orders in as fast as three hours on electric vehicles, and we use biodegradable, reusable boxes to minimize our environmental footprint.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "573AF44821",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 154,
        "text": "I have no doubt that our offerings will continue to grow, but it will take time, and I know a lot more people are needed to shape the future of good food.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E8ABD0912",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 277,
        "text": "So last year, I founded China's first food tech accelerator and VC platform to help start-ups to shape the future of good food the way they want, be that through using edible insects as a more sustainable source of protein or using essential oils to keep food fresh for longer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5E5808D78",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "So, you may still ask: Why are you trying to build a sustainable food system by driving a patient movement in a country where it's almost a crime to take it slow?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4525F60DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 17,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "the real secret to success is patience",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "99B2C720F8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 59,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "a mindful kind of patience that requires knowing how to act while waiting",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "244A461E1F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 170,
        "endOffset": 196,
        "text": "my grandmother's magic box",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C107DB0DA9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "After all, we do not inherit the earth from our ancestors.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B738B280A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 3,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "borrow it from our children",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "127211AE22",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "886AD1D6DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C746AA7AE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}